        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d4010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Walk round the vehicle and check each item before you drive it. Fill this sheet in every day, even when you find nothing wrong: a check with no defects is still a record that the check was done.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
